<title>USA: Fluke sees Q4 restructuring charge.</title>
<headline>Fluke sees Q4 restructuring charge.</headline>
<dateline>EVERETT, Wash. 1997-01-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Fluke Corp on Tuesday said it would restructure its European operations and expected to take a related charge of $9 million to $11 million in the fourth quarter ending April 25.</p>
<p>The company said the restructuring will involve the closing of all its product-development operations in Hamburg, Germany, and the transfer of business responsibilities from Hamburg to Almelo in the Netherlands.</p>
